      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. specifically looking for any drift in the 'long-tail' content. i've heard some rumors that the new compute-saving measures might be pushing the engine toward more repetitive, low-variance content clusters. can you dig into the latent space distribution and let me know if there's been any intentional or unintentional narrowing of the recommendation breadth?",
